WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.220 position:50%,center size:84% align:center
有些工作，得看著介面來做

2
00:00:03.220 --> 00:00:05.646 position:50%,center size:84% align:center
比如 Blender，或者 MD

3
00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:11.010 position:50%,center size:84% align:center
用 yomado 新增一塊虛擬螢幕

4
00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:12.450 position:50%,center size:84% align:center
取名 Codex

5
00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:14.737 position:50%,center size:84% align:center
給 Agent 一塊專用的工作螢幕

6
00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:22.010 position:50%,center size:84% align:center
把它需要的 App 拖進去

7
00:00:22.010 --> 00:00:24.170 position:50%,center size:84% align:center
Blender，MD

8
00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:26.090 position:50%,center size:84% align:center
你自己開啟的其他視窗

9
00:00:26.090 --> 00:00:27.574 position:50%,center size:84% align:center
留在原來的位置

10
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:35.260 position:50%,center size:84% align:center
Agent 看截圖、點控制項、輸入文字

11
00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:37.100 position:50%,center size:84% align:center
App 沒有專屬的 MCP

12
00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:38.893 position:50%,center size:84% align:center
也能透過視覺來操作

13
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:46.080 position:50%,center size:84% align:center
再給 GrokBot 一塊螢幕

14
00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:48.240 position:50%,center size:84% align:center
需要時，把 App 拖回來

15
00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:50.531 position:50%,center size:84% align:center
用完再關掉對應的虛擬螢幕

16
00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:56.560 position:50%,center size:84% align:center
yomado，夜窗

17
00:00:56.560 --> 00:00:57.718 position:50%,center size:84% align:center
去官網下載
